[{"code":"program_shape","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":39,"col":9},"end":{"line":39,"col":10}},"title":"PROGRAM SHAPE","message":"The function this `Html.map` applies to the messages of its markup is not a\nconstructor of the program's message, so which key each of those messages\nreaches cannot be known when the program is built, and `browser-inline` calls a\nkey's handler directly, with no message made (`docs/design/browser-inline.md`\n§8.7; §5, class 3). Map with a constructor — `Html.map (Widget.view model.count)\nUp` — and decide in `update` what the message means."}]
